AB  - This project shows a unique way to learn about AYUSH herbal plants in a simple and effective approach. Ayurveda, yoga and naturopathy, homeopathy, Unani, and siddha are all included in AYUSH. The system has the knowledge about herbal plants. The problem was the information was scattered largely, which made a difficulty for users to understand and study it. So, we created a VR system that has all information about all the plants that is present in that area. You can use this project to get to know about the required plant's history, scientific name, its uses in health-related cases, possible treatments we can give. We can see the garden in a real time how they appear on the land; we can see that in three dimensions to know about the plants. Other people who tried to undertake a similar project claimed that it was impossible to impart simple knowledge like the knowledge that we imparted. Also, they believed it is an easy-to-handle and project-making tool for medicinal plants. This is actually an effective method for gaining information about the medicinal plants because it talks about the uses of VR in the whole project as it is of high value and has a broader future. It allows the user to create their own virtual garden by choosing the soil type, land area, and number of plants. This gives the users feedback on things like plant density, soil suitability, available space, and the rate at which the selected plants produce oxygen. It guarantees that users will have an educational and virtual reality experience.
