AB  - A Multimodal Emotion Recognition and Interaction System is presented that blends deep-learning and Generative AI with an Augmented Reality avatar to foster truly empathetic, human-like conversations. By processing text, speech intonation, and facial micro-expressions in parallel, our pipeline achieves robust emotion detection across diverse contexts. We fine-tune transformer-based models on open-source emotion corpora (GoEmotions, EmpatheticDialogues) and leverage a custom "Counsel-Chat" dataset to enable continuous, personalized learning. The AR avatar then mirrors the user’s mood through nuanced gestures and tone, creating an immersive feedback loop that feels more engaging than traditional interfaces. Experimental evaluation demonstrates that our model achieves 94.8% accuracy, 93.5% precision, 92.7% recall, and a 93.1% F1-score, significantly outperforming baseline CNN, RNN, and standard LSTM approaches.
